    "text": "Enjoys reading, finished 'The Martian' on holiday and found it a perfect beach read (2026-08-16) Ordered new headphones, expected to arrive Friday (2026-08-20) Finished reading 'Piranesi' by Susanna Clarke, thought it strange and beautiful. Watched the new season of that detective show and thought the ending was silly. (2026-09-13) Started reading 'The Overstory' today, thought it huge (2026-09-15) Resolved a bank issue after an hour-long phone call (2026-09-20) Gave up on 'The Overstory', found it too slow (2026-09-22) Spent the whole evening fixing a bug in our CI pipeline (2026-09-23) Listened to a podcast about sleep and feels they need more sleep. (2026-09-25) Started the audiobook of 'Project Hail Mary' for my commute. Had a long day, ate pizza and went to bed early (2026-09-30). Felt tired and slept poorly (2026-10-01). Made a big pot of lentil soup, good for three days. (2026-10-03) Finished 'Project Hail Mary' and loved the ending. (2026-10-06) Finished reading 'Klara and the Sun' on the train home. (2026-10-11) 'Klara and the Sun' stayed with me all day, what a quiet ending. (2026-10-12) Reports that their laptop battery is dying fast and asks for tips. Read 'Station Eleven' over the weekend and couldn't put it down. (2026-10-15) Almost done with 'The Remains of the Day', twenty pages left. (2026-10-18) Had many meetings on Monday (2026-10-23) Finished 'The Remains of the Day' (2026-10-25). Started reading 'Tomorrow, and Tomorrow, and Tomorrow' tonight. (2026-10-27) Tried 'Normal People' but stopped at chapter three, finding it not for them (2026-10-29)",
